{
  "slug": "jfrog",
  "name": "Jfrog",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Use the JFrog Platform from Claude Code: Artifactory repos and artifacts, security findings and exposures, Catalog package safety and downloads, workflows across the SDLC, and platform administration.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **7 skills**, **4 hooks** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (7): `jfrog` (Interact with the JFrog Platform via the JFrog CLI, JFrog MCP server and REST/GraphQL APIs), `jfrog-ai-catalog` (Discover, search, install, update, remove, and publish agent skills and plugins hosted in the JFrog AI Catalog (Artifactory)…), `jfrog-init` (Set up and verify the JFrog plugin), `jfrog-mcp-management` (Use to install, list, or remove MCP servers, and to discover which MCPs the user can install —…), `jfrog-package-curation` (Check/download a package (npm, Maven, PyPI, Go...) via JFrog — safe, allowed, curated), `jfrog-reference-architecture` (Guides JFrog Platform topology, sizing (RPM, t-shirt templates), deployment, multi-site use cases, SaaS vs self-managed, HA, air-gapped, and…), `jfrog-setup-package-managers` (Use this skill when the user asks to set up, configure, bind, or connect a package manager (npm,…)\n- **Hooks** (4): `SessionStart`, `FileChanged`, `PreToolUse`, `UserPromptExpansion`\n- **MCP servers** (1): `jfrog`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install jfrog@claude-plugins-official` from `jfrog/claude-plugin`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 7,
    "hook": 4,
    "mcp": 1
  },
